# Recovery strategies -- test drive, not a construction. NEGATIVE. One case per clause:
#  RestartDeclaresStrategyShape  R0 declares none.
#  DecreaseByFactorShape         R_F second restart, reductionObserved 0.25.
#  VariableDecreaseShape         R_V2 reduction 0.3 after R_V1's 0.6.
#  DivideAndConquerShape         R_D one part only; part P_bad no parent/deliverable; item S_D in no part.
#  CombineOutputShape            C_bad combines a retracted output; misses P_ok's active Backlog output.
#  TransformStrategyShape        R_S no ScopeChange; R_R bypassed epic undecomposed; R_T template = self.
#  SubmittedToOwnInboxShape      EP_own submitted only to 07-handover-inbox/pending/...
# Witness: ScopeChange SC after R_S2 (simplify restart) -> order check problem; L_S2 BYPASS.
